<section class="calculator-section active" aria-labelledby="practicalTitle">
    <h2 id="practicalTitle">하루 임금과 종일 휴업일수 입력</h2>
    <form id="practicalForm" data-practical-tool="shutdown">
        <div class="tax-form-card form-grid">
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-average">1일 평균임금 (원)</label><input id="practical-average" name="average" aria-describedby="practical-average-help" type="text" class="money-input" inputmode="numeric" value="120,000" required><small id="practical-average-help">발생 사유 전 3개월을 기준으로 산정한 1일 평균임금입니다.</small></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-ordinary">1일 통상임금 (원)</label><input id="practical-ordinary" name="ordinary" aria-describedby="practical-ordinary-help" type="text" class="money-input" inputmode="numeric" value="80,000" required><small id="practical-ordinary-help">시간급이 있다면 1일 소정근로시간 기준 금액을 확인하세요.</small></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-days">종일 휴업한 소정근로일 (일)</label><input id="practical-days" name="days" aria-describedby="practical-days-help" type="number" value="5" min="1" max="365" step="1" required><small id="practical-days-help">일하기로 정한 날 중 종일 휴업한 날만 포함하세요.</small></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-paidPerDay">이미 받은 하루 휴업수당 (원)</label><input id="practical-paidPerDay" name="paidPerDay" aria-describedby="practical-paidPerDay-help" type="text" class="money-input" inputmode="numeric" value="0" required><small id="practical-paidPerDay-help">미지급이면 0원을 넣으세요. 하루 금액이 같은 경우만 반영합니다.</small></div>
